@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> MapCreation : User creates a map
MapCreation --> TimerSetup : User sets timer
MapCreation --> NoteAddition : User adds notes
MapCreation --> MapViewing : User views map
TimerSetup --> TimerActive : Timer starts
TimerActive --> ActionTriggered : Timer triggers action
MapViewing --> MapSaved : Map saved
MapViewing --> MapAccess : Map accessed later
ActionTriggered --> MapViewing : Return to view map
MapSaved --> MapAccess : Access saved map
MapAccess --> MapViewing : View accessed map
MapViewing --> Exit : User exits
Exit --> [*]
@enduml
